---
import mascotImg from '../assets/jihoo-no-bg.png';

const quips = [
  "hello!",
  "boo!",
  "have you tried NixOS btw",
  "the ai agent wrote this line, not me",
  "segfault? never heard of her",
  "noctalia shell looking clean today",
  "rawr x3",
  "nyaa~",
  "uwu",
  "hehe :3",
  "peekaboo!",
  "go read that HoTT book already",
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="-XugzPp_Zk_0xP3B20_EYYY-9wI07ZA4CFNkDe27ITY" />
  <title>jihoo — rust, compilers, nixos</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Jihoo's corner of the internet — Rust, compilers, operating systems, and a NixOS + niri + noctalia setup." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/jihoo.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="crt-line">jihoo<span class="dim">@</span>dev<span class="accent">:~$</span> <span class="caret">▍</span></p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="accent">Jihoo</span>.</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Rust by default. Compilers and operating systems by obsession.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="bio">
      <p>I'm <span class="accent">Jihoo</span> — an undergraduate who lives and breathes systems-level code. My main languages are <span class="accent">Rust</span>, <span class="accent">C++</span>, <span class="accent">C</span>, and <span class="accent">Astro</span>, and I'm happiest when I'm deep in a compiler or poking around inside an operating system kernel. You can find me on <a class="link" href="https://github.com/jihoo12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
      <p>My day-to-day setup is <span class="accent">NixOS</span> on both my desktop and laptop — the desktop runs <span class="accent">GNOME</span>, while the laptop runs <span class="accent">niri</span> and <span class="accent">noctalia shell</span>. Nix is more than a package manager to me; it's how I think about reproducibility and system design. Beyond that, I'm fascinated by <span class="accent">compilers</span> and language implementation, <span class="accent">AI agents</span> and how they're reshaping the way we write software, <span class="accent">Lisp</span> and its family of languages, and <span class="accent">Cubical type theory</span> — which sits at this beautiful intersection of type theory, homotopy theory, and constructive mathematics that I find endlessly compelling. Outside of code, I enjoy dabbling in <span class="accent">philosophical thinking</span> — nothing rigorous, just casual reading around East Asian traditions like <span class="accent">Buddhism</span> and <span class="accent">Taoism</span>, and lately <span class="accent">Plato</span>'s ideas too. There's something about impermanence and non-duality on one side, and the theory of Forms on the other, that feels oddly resonant with how I think about types and computation.</p>
      <p>I reach for an AI agent constantly while coding.</p>
      <p>Right now there's a small stack on my desk — <span class="accent">Cubical Type Theory</span>, <span class="accent">HoTT</span>, and a <span class="accent">category theory</span> pdf — all patiently waiting for me to open them. I fully intend to. Any day now. In the meantime I have, somehow, found time for everything except that.</p>
      <p>These days I'm studying <span class="accent">Haskell</span> and <span class="accent">type theory</span> properly over in <a class="link" href="https://github.com/jihoo12/dragonfly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dragonfly</a>, working through the fundamentals instead of winging it. In parallel, I'm building the kernel of a proof assistant in <a class="link" href="https://github.com/jihoo12/menhera-potato" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">menhera-potato</a>.</p>    <p>On the OS side, I'm building <a class="link" href="https://github.com/jihoo12/kaguyaos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">KaguyaOS</a> — a hobby OS written in Rust targeting x86_64 UEFI. It boots via UEFI with a GOP framebuffer, enforces ring 0/3 isolation with 25 system calls, runs a cooperative round-robin scheduler with SMP support, and has drivers for xHCI USB, NVMe SSD, and E1000 Ethernet. There's a FAT16 filesystem and a shell to tie it all together.</p>    
    </section>
    <footer class="foot">
      <p class="crt-line dim">jihoo@dev<span class="accent">:~$</span> <span class="caret">▍</span></p>
    </footer>
  </main>
  <div id="mascot" class="mascot" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="A small penguin-jacket character. Click before it runs off.">
    <div id="mascot-bubble" class="bubble"></div>
    <img src={mascotImg.src} alt="" draggable="false" />
  </div>
  <script define:vars={{ quips }}>
    const mascot = document.getElementById('mascot');
    const bubble = document.getElementById('mascot-bubble');
    const img = mascot.querySelector('img');
    let retreatTimer = null;
    let hasFled = false;
    function rand(min, max) {
      return Math.random() * (max - min) + min;
    }
    function pickQuip() {
      return quips[Math.floor(Math.random() * quips.length)];
    }
    function reset(instant) {
      mascot.style.transition = instant ? 'none' : '';
      mascot.style.opacity = '0';
      mascot.style.pointerEvents = 'none';
      mascot.style.right = '-180px';
    }
    function scheduleNext(delayMs) {
      clearTimeout(retreatTimer);
      const delay = delayMs !== undefined ? delayMs : rand(9000, 22000);
      setTimeout(popIn, delay);
    }
    function popIn() {
      reset(true);
      void mascot.offsetWidth;
      mascot.style.transition =
        'right .6s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1), opacity .3s ease';
      bubble.textContent = pickQuip();
      requestAnimationFrame(() => {
        mascot.style.opacity = '1';
        mascot.style.pointerEvents = 'auto';
        mascot.style.right = '14px';
        bubble.classList.add('show');
      });
      retreatTimer = setTimeout(() => retreat(), rand(3800, 5200));
    }
    function retreat() {
      bubble.classList.remove('show');
      mascot.style.transition =
        'right .5s ease-in, opacity .5s ease';
      mascot.style.right = '-180px';
      mascot.style.opacity = '0';
      setTimeout(() => {
        mascot.style.pointerEvents = 'none';
        scheduleNext();
      }, 550);
    }
    function flee() {
      clearTimeout(retreatTimer);
      bubble.classList.remove('show');
      mascot.style.transition =
        'right .7s cubic-bezier(.55,-0.4,.7,.3), opacity .6s ease .1s';
      mascot.style.right = 'calc(100vw + 40px)';
      mascot.style.opacity = '0';
      hasFled = true;
      setTimeout(() => {
        mascot.style.pointerEvents = 'none';
        reset(true);
        void mascot.offsetWidth;
        scheduleNext(hasFled ? rand(14000, 30000) : undefined);
      }, 750);
    }
    mascot.addEventListener('click', flee);
    mascot.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
        e.preventDefault();
        flee();
      }
    });
    reset(true);
    scheduleNext(rand(2500, 6000));
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #100f0c;
      --panel: #1a1812;
      --panel-2: #211f17;
      --border: #362f1f;
      --text: #e9e2cf;
      --dim: #938d78;
      --rust: #cc7a3c;
      --olive: #7c8462;
      --blue: #6688b5;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    body {
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(204,122,60,0.06), transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(102,136,181,0.05), transparent 45%);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 64px 24px 40px;
    }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .crt-line {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .crt-line.dim { margin-top: 0; }
    .caret {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--rust);
      animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
    }
    @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .accent { color: var(--rust); }
    .tagline {
      color: var(--dim);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 46ch;
    }
    .bio {
      max-width: 60ch;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .bio p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .link {
      color: var(--rust);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rust);
    }
    .link:hover { color: var(--text); border-bottom-color: var(--text); }
    .foot { margin-top: 36px; }
    /* mascot easter egg */
    .mascot {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 150px;
      z-index: 200;
      opacity: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .mascot img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.45));
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-drag: none;
    }
    @keyframes bob {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
    }
    .bubble {
      position: absolute;
      top: -6px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -100%);
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--rust);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      width: 190px;
      max-width: 58vw;
      text-align: center;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .bubble.show { opacity: 1; }
    .bubble::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -6px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--rust);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rust);
      rotate: 45deg;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .mascot { animation: none; }
      .mascot, .bubble { transition: opacity .3s ease !important; }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>